{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the captain of a state-of-the-art flying ship and embark on a perilous journey through space in search of your missing father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious worlds, collect occult artefacts, and confront hostile forces that stand in your way. In this concise and memorable Action-Adventure RPG, your choices shape the story as you upgrade your ship, meet unique characters, and uncover the dark truths hidden behind the Veil.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control a flying ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Upgrade your ship, power the engines, and ready your cannons as you navigate an uncharted solar system filled with danger and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/8e3ac3158eb10d8177763ecbaaef8e14.poster.avif?t=1747664660\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/8e3ac3158eb10d8177763ecbaaef8e14.webm?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/8e3ac3158eb10d8177763ecbaaef8e14.mp4?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Choose your strengths, make your choices, and suffer the consequences. Trust or doubt be brave or run away, the choice is yours and it will determine how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/b5362d3b1776254eb4379a88a34df849.poster.avif?t=1747664660\" width=582 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/b5362d3b1776254eb4379a88a34df849.webm?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/b5362d3b1776254eb4379a88a34df849.mp4?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight to Survive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Face unnatural threats as you delve deeper into the unknown. Experience ship-to-ship battles and gun down ancient alien constructs as you carve your path among the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/4ea588c34870f33353a583e55f480725.poster.avif?t=1747664660\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/4ea588c34870f33353a583e55f480725.webm?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/4ea588c34870f33353a583e55f480725.mp4?t=1747664660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resist the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange murmurs arise from the gaps between realities, and twisted shapes form at the corners of your mind. Test your resolve as you stare behind the Veil, battling to keep your sanity intact.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras/5a44950022ff4c4ef338a34fa72cccbe.avif?t=1747664660\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367690/extras_big/5a44950022ff4c4ef338a34fa72cccbe.avif?t=1747664660 width=800 height=326 /></span><